    "sha256": "57bf1805378486c252352f3cbeafdf3388fbad4a3d9d8a2a3ad44410d09e22e8",
    "content": "AMP_Xparams.mdl:\n\n\tThis x-parameters file is extracted from an AMP designed in Keysight ADS.  The extraction is performed under the following conditions:\n\t(1) 2 fundamental frequencies (2 tones): 1GHz and 1.2GHz\n\t(2) Power sweep at each frequency from -30 dBm to 10 dBm at 10 dB step\n\t(3) DC bias is at 10 Volts\n\t(4) The maximum order (harmonic number) of the fundamental(s) that will be considered is 5\n\t(5) The maximum mixing order is 3"
  },
